/target
**/*.rs.bk
.DS_Store
**/.conway/sessions/
**/.conway/paths/
# The path store's directory is derived from the session root's own name, so
# when the session root moved to a central project-keyed location the sibling
# became `<root>-paths` rather than `paths`. The pattern above stopped
# matching and test runs started leaving content-addressed blobs in seven
# crate directories. Board item 01M0QK9GRM8HSNWRAR414TCX42.
**/.conway/sessions-paths/

# ideate metadata — local-only tooling state (not tracked)
.ideate/
.ideate.json
.ideate-work/
.ideate-telemetry/